DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash reference implementation (test oracle)
==========================================================

model.py, engram.py, image_processor.py and vision.py are copied without changes from the
`inference/` folder of the deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash model repository, licensed under the
MIT License (copy in LICENSE next to this file).

kernel.py is not the released file: the released one is tilelang. This one maps the same
functions onto lumenrl.models.deepseek_v41.ops so the reference runs on CPU with BF16 weights.
